[*] AoU layout : dv/sv directed TB (tb_axi_ucie_mem, default NUM_RP=1 OOO_EN=0).
[*]
[*] Same group scheme as dv/waves/default.gtkw, re-rooted at the SV testbench
[*] (tb_axi_ucie_mem.dut...) - the cocotb dump has axi_ucie_mem_top as its top,
[*] this one wraps it in a TB, so the layouts cannot be shared.  The TB's own
[*] scoreboard counters (reads / errors) ride at the top so a failing beat is
[*] immediately locatable in time.
[*]
[*] wave-check: env=sv
[dumpfile] "dv/sv/sim_build/tb_axi_ucie_mem.fst"
[timestart] 0
[sst_width] 300
[signals_width] 380
[pane_width] 1240
[treeopen] tb_axi_ucie_mem.
[treeopen] tb_axi_ucie_mem.dut.
[treeopen] tb_axi_ucie_mem.dut.g_rp1.
